#: ../../../get_started/targets.md:1
msgid "Understanding Targets"
msgstr "理解编译目标"

#: ../../../get_started/targets.md:3
msgid ""
"TileLang is built on top of TVM, which relies on **targets** to describe the "
"device you want to compile for. The target determines which code generator "
"is used (CUDA, HIP, Metal, LLVM, …) and allows you to pass device-specific "
"options such as GPU architecture flags. This page summarises how to pick and "
"customise a target when compiling TileLang programs."
msgstr ""
"TileLang 构建于 TVM 之上，TVM 依赖**编译目标（target）**来描述您要编译的目标设备。编译目标决定使用哪个代码生成器"
"（CUDA、HIP、Metal、LLVM 等），并允许您传递特定于设备的选项，例如 GPU 架构标志。本页面总结了在编译 TileLang 程序时如何选择和自定义编译目标。"

#: ../../../get_started/targets.md:8
msgid "Common target strings"
msgstr "常用编译目标字符串"

#: ../../../get_started/targets.md:10
msgid ""
"TileLang ships with a small set of common targets; each accepts the full "
"range of TVM options so you can fine-tune the generated code. The most "
"frequent choices are listed below:"
msgstr ""
"TileLang 内置了一小组常用编译目标；每个都接受完整的 TVM 选项，以便您微调生成的代码。以下列出了最常用的选择："

#: ../../../get_started/targets.md:0
msgid "Base name"
msgstr "基础名称"

#: ../../../get_started/targets.md:0
msgid "Description"
msgstr "描述"

#: ../../../get_started/targets.md:0
msgid "`auto`"
msgstr "`auto`"

#: ../../../get_started/targets.md:0
msgid ""
"Detects CUDA → HIP → Metal in that order. Useful when running the same "
"script across machines."
msgstr ""
"按 CUDA → HIP → Metal 的顺序依次检测。适用于跨机器运行同一脚本的场景。"

#: ../../../get_started/targets.md:0
msgid "`cuda`"
msgstr "`cuda`"

#: ../../../get_started/targets.md:0
msgid ""
"NVIDIA GPUs. Supports options such as `-arch=sm_80`, `-"
"max_num_threads=1024`, etc."
msgstr ""
"NVIDIA GPU。支持 `-arch=sm_80`、`-max_num_threads=1024` 等选项。"

#: ../../../get_started/targets.md:0
msgid "`cutedsl`"
msgstr "`cutedsl`"

#: ../../../get_started/targets.md:0
msgid ""
"NVIDIA CUTLASS/CuTe DSL backend. Requires `nvidia-cutlass-dsl`. `cuda` "
"options can also be applied to this target."
msgstr ""
"NVIDIA CUTLASS/CuTe DSL 后端。需要 `nvidia-cutlass-dsl`。`cuda` 的选项同样适用于该编译目标。"

#: ../../../get_started/targets.md:0
msgid "`hip`"
msgstr "`hip`"

#: ../../../get_started/targets.md:0
msgid "AMD GPUs via ROCm. Options like `-mcpu=gfx90a` can be appended."
msgstr "通过 ROCm 支持 AMD GPU。可追加 `-mcpu=gfx90a` 等选项。"

#: ../../../get_started/targets.md:0
msgid "`metal`"
msgstr "`metal`"

#: ../../../get_started/targets.md:0
msgid "Apple Silicon GPUs (arm64 Macs)."
msgstr "Apple Silicon GPU（arm64 Mac）。"

#: ../../../get_started/targets.md:0
msgid "`llvm`"
msgstr "`llvm`"

#: ../../../get_started/targets.md:0
msgid "CPU execution; accepts the standard TVM LLVM switches."
msgstr "CPU 执行；接受标准的 TVM LLVM 开关参数。"

#: ../../../get_started/targets.md:0
msgid "`webgpu`"
msgstr "`webgpu`"

#: ../../../get_started/targets.md:0
msgid "Browser / WebGPU runtimes."
msgstr "浏览器 / WebGPU 运行时。"

#: ../../../get_started/targets.md:0
msgid "`c`"
msgstr "`c`"

#: ../../../get_started/targets.md:0
msgid "Emit plain C source for inspection or custom toolchains."
msgstr "生成纯 C 源代码，供查看或用于自定义工具链。"

#: ../../../get_started/targets.md:24
msgid ""
"To add options, append them after the base name, separated by spaces. For "
"example:"
msgstr ""
"要添加选项，请在基础名称后以空格分隔追加。例如："

#: ../../../get_started/targets.md:26
msgid ""
"target = \"cuda -arch=sm_90\"\n"
"kernel = tilelang.compile(func, target=target, "
"execution_backend=\"cython\")\n"
"# or\n"
"@tilelang.jit(target=target)\n"
"def compiled_kernel(*args):\n"
"    return func(*args)\n"
msgstr ""
"target = \"cuda -arch=sm_90\"\n"
"kernel = tilelang.compile(func, target=target, "
"execution_backend=\"cython\")\n"
"# 或者\n"
"@tilelang.jit(target=target)\n"
"def compiled_kernel(*args):\n"
"    return func(*args)\n"

#: ../../../get_started/targets.md:35
msgid ""
"The same convention works for HIP or LLVM (e.g. `hip -mcpu=gfx940`, `llvm -"
"mtriple=x86_64-linux-gnu`)."
msgstr ""
"同样的约定也适用于 HIP 或 LLVM（例如 `hip -mcpu=gfx940`、`llvm -mtriple=x86_64-linux-gnu`）。"

#: ../../../get_started/targets.md:37
msgid "Advanced: Specify Exact Hardware"
msgstr "进阶：指定确切硬件"

#: ../../../get_started/targets.md:39
msgid ""
"When you already know the precise GPU model, you can encode it in the target "
"string—either via `-arch=sm_XX` or by using one of TVM's pre-defined target "
"tags such as `nvidia/nvidia-h100`.  Supplying this detail is optional for "
"TileLang in general use, but it becomes valuable when the TVM cost model is "
"enabled (e.g. during autotuning).  The cost model uses the extra attributes "
"to make better scheduling predictions.  If you skip this step (or do not use "
"the cost model), generic targets like `cuda` or `auto` are perfectly fine."
msgstr ""
"当您已经知道具体的 GPU 型号时，可以将其编码到编译目标字符串中——可通过 `-arch=sm_XX` 或使用 TVM 预定义的编译目标"
"标签（如 `nvidia/nvidia-h100`）。在 TileLang 的一般使用中，提供这些细节是可选的，但当启用 TVM 成本模型时"
"（例如在自动调优期间）则非常有价值。成本模型会利用这些额外属性做出更好的调度预测。如果您跳过这一步"
"（或不使用成本模型），使用 `cuda` 或 `auto` 这样的通用编译目标完全没有问题。"

#: ../../../get_started/targets.md:45
msgid ""
"All CUDA compute capabilities recognised by TVM's target registry are listed "
"below.  Pick the one that matches your GPU and append it to the target "
"string or use the corresponding target tag—for example `nvidia/nvidia-a100`."
msgstr ""
"以下列出了 TVM 编译目标注册表中已识别的所有 CUDA 计算能力。选择与您的 GPU 匹配的一项，将其追加到编译目标字符串中，"
"或使用相应的编译目标标签——例如 `nvidia/nvidia-a100`。"

