#: ../../../get_started/targets.md:74
msgid "Creating targets programmatically"
msgstr "以编程方式创建编译目标"

#: ../../../get_started/targets.md:76
msgid ""
"If you prefer working with TVM's `Target` objects, TileLang exposes the "
"helper `tilelang.utils.target.determine_target` (returns a canonical target "
"string by default, or the `Target` object when `return_object=True`):"
msgstr ""
"如果您更习惯使用 TVM 的 `Target` 对象，TileLang 提供了辅助函数 `tilelang.utils.target.determine_target`"
"（默认返回规范的编译目标字符串，当设置 `return_object=True` 时返回 `Target` 对象）："

#: ../../../get_started/targets.md:80
msgid ""
"from tilelang.utils.target import determine_target\n"
"\n"
"tvm_target = determine_target(\"cuda -arch=sm_80\", return_object=True)\n"
"kernel = tilelang.compile(func, target=tvm_target)\n"
msgstr ""
"from tilelang.utils.target import determine_target\n"
"\n"
"tvm_target = determine_target(\"cuda -arch=sm_80\", return_object=True)\n"
"kernel = tilelang.compile(func, target=tvm_target)\n"

#: ../../../get_started/targets.md:87
msgid "You can also build targets directly through TVM:"
msgstr "您也可以直接通过 TVM 构建编译目标："

#: ../../../get_started/targets.md:89
msgid ""
"from tvm.target import Target\n"
"\n"
"target = Target(\"cuda\", host=\"llvm\")\n"
"target = target.with_host(Target(\"llvm -mcpu=skylake\"))\n"
msgstr ""
"from tvm.target import Target\n"
"\n"
"target = Target(\"cuda\", host=\"llvm\")\n"
"target = target.with_host(Target(\"llvm -mcpu=skylake\"))\n"

#: ../../../get_started/targets.md:96
msgid ""
"TileLang accepts either `str` or `Target` inputs; internally they are "
"normalised and cached using the canonical string representation.  **In user "
"code we strongly recommend passing target strings rather than `tvm.target."
"Target` instances—strings keep cache keys compact and deterministic across "
"runs, whereas constructing fresh `Target` objects may lead to slightly "
"higher hashing overhead or inconsistent identity semantics.**"
msgstr ""
"TileLang 接受 `str` 或 `Target` 输入；内部会使用规范的字符串表示对其进行标准化和缓存。"
"**在用户代码中，我们强烈建议传递编译目标字符串，而不是 `tvm.target.Target` 实例——"
"字符串可以保持缓存键在多次运行中紧凑且确定，而每次构建新的 `Target` 对象可能会导致稍高的哈希开销或标识语义不一致。**"

#: ../../../get_started/targets.md:101
msgid "Discovering supported targets in code"
msgstr "在代码中查看支持的编译目标"

#: ../../../get_started/targets.md:103
msgid ""
"Looking for a quick reminder of the built-in base names and their "
"descriptions? Use:"
msgstr ""
"想快速查看内置基础名称及其描述？请使用："

#: ../../../get_started/targets.md:105
msgid ""
"from tilelang.utils.target import describe_supported_targets\n"
"\n"
"for name, doc in describe_supported_targets().items():\n"
"    print(f\"{name:>6}: {doc}\")\n"
msgstr ""
"from tilelang.utils.target import describe_supported_targets\n"
"\n"
"for name, doc in describe_supported_targets().items():\n"
"    print(f\"{name:>6}: {doc}\")\n"

