#: ../../../get_started/targets.md:114
msgid "Troubleshooting tips"
msgstr "故障排除提示"

#: ../../../get_started/targets.md:116
msgid ""
"If you see `Target cuda -arch=sm_80 is not supported`, double-check the "
"spellings and that the option is valid for TVM. Any invalid switch will "
"surface as a target-construction error."
msgstr ""
"如果您看到 `Target cuda -arch=sm_80 is not supported`，请仔细检查拼写并确认该选项对 TVM 有效。"
"任何无效的开关都会表现为编译目标构建错误。"

#: ../../../get_started/targets.md:118
msgid ""
"Runtime errors such as \"no kernel image is available\" usually mean the `-"
"arch` flag does not match the GPU you are running on. Try dropping the flag "
"or switching to the correct compute capability."
msgstr ""
"运行时错误（如 \"no kernel image is available\"）通常意味着 `-arch` 标志与您正在运行的 GPU 不匹配。"
"请尝试去掉该标志或切换到正确的计算能力。"

#: ../../../get_started/targets.md:120
msgid ""
"When targeting multiple environments, use `auto` for convenience and "
"override with an explicit string only when you need architecture-specific "
"tuning."
msgstr ""
"当面向多种环境编译时，使用 `auto` 更为便捷；仅在需要进行架构特定调优时才用显式字符串进行覆盖。"
